title: Party Dues
card-image: img/cards/fundraising.svg?v=2
subtitle: Collect dues and keep the press going.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: fundraising_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; fundraising_timer = 4

Dues are the party's lifeblood. They are paid in kopecks, in factories and in unions, and not always on time.

- @dues: Ordinary dues. [? if dues_income <= 1 : (Few members are left to pay.) ?]
- @appeal: A special appeal to the members. (More money, but some members will drift away.)
- @coops: Ask the cooperatives and the unions for support.
- @easy_discard

@dues
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources += Q.dues_income;
!}

The collectors made their rounds. The money arrives slowly, but it arrives.

@appeal
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources += Math.max(2, Math.round(Q.dues_income * 1.5));
// asking too much costs members, and patience in every current
Q.members = Math.max(3, Q.members - 2 * Q.mem_scale);
RO.fac(Q, 'unions', 0, 5);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 0, 5);
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', 0, 3);
!}

A special appeal brought in more. Some members complained about being asked, and some stopped coming to meetings.

@coops
view-if: unions_strength >= 5
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources += 2;
RO.fac(Q, 'unions', 3, 0);
RO.add(Q, {bread: 2, ruble: 1});
!}

The cooperatives are friendly to us, and have lent a hall, some paper and a little money. The union leaders expect that we will remember it.
